```

### `index.html`

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Electron worker startup repro</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #202124; color: #e8eaed; font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif; }
        main { width: min(520px, calc(100vw - 48px)); text-align: center; }
        .loader { width: 48px; height: 48px; margin: 0 auto 18px; border: 4px solid #5f6368; border-top-color: #8ab4f8; border-radius: 50%; animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite; }
        .grid { display: none; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin-top: 20px; }
        .cell { height: 64px; display: grid; place-items: center; border: 1px solid #5f6368; border-radius: 8px; background: #303134; font-weight: 600; }
        body.ready .loader, body.ready .waiting { display: none; }
        body.ready .grid { display: grid; }
        body.ready .ready-message { display: block; }
        .ready-message { display: none; }
        @keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="spinner">
    <main>
        <div class="loader"></div>
        <h1 class="waiting">Waiting for IPC</h1>
        <p class="waiting">The grid should replace this spinner about one second after launch.</p>
        <h1 class="ready-message">Grid shown</h1>
        <p class="ready-message">IPC delay: <span id="delay"></span></p>
        <section class="grid" aria-label="Loaded grid">
            <div class="cell">A1</div><div class="cell">A2</div><div class="cell">A3</div><div class="cell">A4</div>
            <div class="cell">B1</div><div class="cell">B2</div><div class="cell">B3</div><div class="cell">B4</div>
            <div class="cell">C1</div><div class="cell">C2</div><div class="cell">C3</div><div class="cell">C4</div>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
```

